## 框架方言

### React�?tsx/.jsx�?- Props: `camelCase`（如 `type="primary"`、`loading={true}`�?- 事件: `onClick={handler}`（不能省�?`={}`�?- 布尔: `disabled={true}`（不能省�?`={true}`�?
### Vue�?vue�?- Props: `kebab-case` �?`:binding`（如 `type="primary"`、`:loading="true"`�?- 事件: `@click="handler"`（使�?`@` 前缀�?- 布尔: `:disabled="true"`（必须用 `:` 绑定�?
## 组件速查

| 组件 | 用�?| React | Vue |
|------|------|-------|-----|
| Page | 页面容器 | `<Page title="标题" onBack={fn}>...</Page>` | `<Page title="标题" @back="fn">...</Page>` |
| Grid | 栅格 | `<Grid cols={2} gap="md">...</Grid>` | `<Grid cols="2" gap="md">...</Grid>` |
| Form | 表单 | `<Form onFinish={fn}>...</Form>` | `<Form @finish="fn">...</Form>` |
| Form.Item | 表单�?| `<Form.Item name="email" label="邮箱">...</Form.Item>` | `<Form.Item name="email" label="邮箱">...</Form.Item>` |
| Button | 按钮 | `<Button type="primary" onClick={fn}>提交</Button>` | `<Button type="primary" @click="fn">提交</Button>` |
| Input | 输入�?| `<Input placeholder="请输�? />` | `<Input placeholder="请输�? />` |
| Select | 选择�?| `<Select options={opts} />` | `<Select :options="opts" />` |
| Modal | 对话�?| `<Modal visible={o} onOk={fn}>...</Modal>` | `<Modal :visible="o" @ok="fn">...</Modal>` |
| Empty | 空状�?| `<Empty description="暂无数据" />` | `<Empty description="暂无数据" />` |
| Skeleton | 骨架�?| `<Skeleton loading type="list" rows={3}>...</Skeleton>` | `<Skeleton :loading :rows="3">...</Skeleton>` |
| Tag | 标签 | `<Tag color="success">完成</Tag>` | `<Tag color="success">完成</Tag>` |
| Badge | 徽标 | `<Badge count={5}><Icon /></Badge>` | `<Badge :count="5"><Icon /></Badge>` |
| Avatar | 头像 | `<Avatar src={url} size="lg" />` | `<Avatar :src="url" size="lg" />` |
| Tabs | 标签�?| `<Tabs items={items} activeKey={k} onChange={setK} />` | `<Tabs :items="items" :activeKey="k" @change="setK" />` |
| Drawer | 抽屉 | `<Drawer visible={o} onClose={close}>...</Drawer>` | `<Drawer :visible="o" @close="close">...</Drawer>` |

## 设计令牌

```typescript
import { colors, spacing, radius } from '@yaomingshan/core';

colors.primary.DEFAULT  // 主色背景
colors.danger.text      // 危险色文�?colors.success.bg       // 成功色背�?spacing.md              // 16px
radius.lg               // 8px
radius.full             // 9999px（药丸形�?```

## 违规示例

�?禁止：原�?HTML + 内联样式
```tsx
<div style={{ padding: 16 }}>
  <button style={{ background: '#1677ff', color: 'white' }}>提交</button>
</div>
```

�?正确：AUI 组件 + Tailwind
```tsx
import { Page, Button } from '@yaomingshan/react';
<Page><Button type="primary">提交</Button></Page>
```

�?禁止：不包裹 Form.Item
```tsx
<Form>
  <div><input placeholder="邮箱" /></div>
  <button type="submit">提交</button>
</Form>
```

�?正确：Form + Form.Item
```tsx
<Form onFinish={handleSubmit}>
  <Form.Item name="email" label="邮箱">
    <Input placeholder="邮箱" />
  </Form.Item>
  <Button type="primary" htmlType="submit">提交</Button>
</Form>
```
